WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:05.783
One proxy. Local HTTPS hostnames. Route each service by path.

00:06.233 --> 00:09.577
Two services share one hostname, split by path.

00:10.033 --> 00:11.055
Start the stack.

00:11.505 --> 00:15.267
devhost starts both and publishes an HTTPS address for each.

00:15.716 --> 00:18.224
The hostname alone reaches the web service.

00:21.036 --> 00:23.497
The API path reaches the API service.

00:25.876 --> 00:28.012
One command stops both services.
